\ === the Master Bathroom ===

\ a plant hanging from the ceiling in its pot, its leaves trailing down
: upper-hanging-plant ( x z drop seed -- )
	| x z drop seed |
	view@cos-yaw to across-x
	view@sin-yaw negate to across-z
	0.3 pen!
	[ 0 2 4 ] ( k | k TAU * 6 / to angle x 2.8 z x angle cos 0.14 * + drop z angle sin 0.14 * + edge ) each
	x drop z 0.14 12 ring to rim
	[ [ x across-x 0.14 * - drop z across-z 0.14 * - ]
	  [ x across-x 0.14 * + drop z across-z 0.14 * + ]
	  [ x across-x 0.09 * + drop 0.2 - z across-z 0.09 * + ]
	  [ x across-x 0.09 * - drop 0.2 - z across-z 0.09 * - ] ] to pot
	pot 0 fill
	rim 0 fill
	0.6 pen!
	pot outline
	rim outline
	0 7 1 do k
		k 7 / TAU * seed + to angle
		seed k + hash-fraction 0.4 * 0.35 + to length
		[ 0 6 1 do step
			step 5 / to along
			[ x angle cos 0.14 along 0.3 * + * + drop 0.05 - along length * - z angle sin 0.14 along 0.3 * + * + ]
		loop ] to strand
		0.3 pen!
		strand path
		0.55 pen!
		1 6 1 do step
			strand step @i spread to leaf-z to leaf-y to leaf-x
			step 2 mod 2 * 1 - 0.05 * to reach
			leaf-x leaf-y leaf-z leaf-x across-x reach * + leaf-y 0.03 - leaf-z across-z reach * + edge
		loop
	loop ;

