\ === the Bedroom Balcony ===

\ the balcony over the orchard: the tops of the tallest fruit trees at its level, the metal railing, the glass door back into the bedroom, and the top of the ladder when it leans here
: bedroom-balcony-picture ( -- )
	2.6 1.7 0.5 -1.15 -0.14 200 new-picture
	[ -30 12 20 ] lamp!
	[ [ 0.4 0 1.2 ] 2.6 0.5 upper-heading [ -1.4 0 0.9 ] 2.6 0.5 upper-heading ] spots!
	\ the distant lawn and lake to the north, the fruit trees below, farthest first
	1.4 pen!
	-60 -3.5 60 4 -3.5 60 edge
	0.6 pen!
	0 6 1 do k k 1.6 * 62 + to z -60 -3.5 z 4 -3.5 z edge loop
	[ -30 6 70 ] 8 0.18 glow
	[ [ -7 0.6 13 2.1 5 ] [ -12 -0.6 5 1.5 3 ] [ -9 0.2 9 2.0 1 ] [ -3 0.4 11 2.2 4 ] [ -5 -0.3 6 1.8 2 ] [ -2 -0.4 4 1.3 6 ] [ 1.0 -0.2 4.4 1.6 7 ] ]
	( tree | tree spread to seed to radius to z to y to x x y z radius -3.5 seed upper-tree-crown ) each
	:ladder-flag-2 state if -1.2 2 -3.5 3.1 upper-ladder-top then
